Make "Open Folder" work in the browser.

Upstream's web FileDialogService never implemented pickFolderAndOpen; it throws
"Can't open folders, try adding a folder to the workspace instead." in every
browser, so the empty-workbench Open Folder button is dead. The machinery
already exists -- showOpenDialog() picks a directory with showDirectoryPicker()
and registers it with HTMLFileSystemProvider -- so call it, and fall back to the
unsupported-browser warning where the File System Access API is missing.

contextkeys.ts is the other half: without it the command is hidden in web, so
the implementation would never be reachable.
